{"message":"The highest documented combined bonus is the Evergreen Account: you receive $35 and your roommate receives $25, for a total of $60. However, the available Evergreen terms do not state a qualifying-deposit amount or deadline, so I can’t confirm that a $600 paycheck alone will satisfy its referral requirements.

The best option with an explicit, verified deposit requirement is the Green Fee-Free Account: you receive $20 and she receives $35, totaling $55. Her $600 paycheck exceeds the required $300 deposit, which must be made within 60 days. You must have had a Rho-Bank checking relationship for at least 30 days.

Your roommate must also be a new Rho-Bank customer, and you must use only one referral or promotional offer for her account. Your addresses being different satisfies that restriction. Based on confirmed requirements, I’d choose Green Fee-Free for the more certain outcome; choose Evergreen only after confirming its current qualifying-deposit terms in your referral dashboard."}
